<title>UK: Prism rights issue to raise 12.4 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Prism rights issue to raise 12.4 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prism Rail Plc said it would make an 11-for-26 rights issue of 5.5 million shares at 240 pence each to raise approximately 12.4 million stg.</p>
<p>It said the issue was to fund the capital requirement laid down by the Office of Passenger Rail Franchising (Opraf) for its franchises of South Wales &amp; West Railway Limited and Cardiff Railway Company Limited, which it was awarded on September 17.</p>
